            <div xml:id="1906_10_22_SD_PS_002">
                <p>En <age value="20">20-årig</age>
                    <person sex="female" role="employee">flicka</person>
                    <placeName type="residence">från landet</placeName> önskar <state type="reason">lära hushåll</state> på en <placeName type="employment">herregård</placeName> i <placeName type="employment" ref="#skane">Skåne</placeName>. Svar till <person sex="unspecified" role="mediator">Gumælii Annonsbyrå</person>, <placeName type="application" ref="#malmö">Malmö</placeName>, märkt '<label>G. G.</label>'. (<idno type="advertisement">GAM. 150183</idno>)</p>
